  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1225199,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 Livres Classiques - Carmen (Nintendo DS) - Synopsis\n\nCarmen Sandiego is back, and she’s orchestrated a daring heist! In *100 Livres Classiques - Carmen* for the Nintendo DS, join ACME agent Julia and tech expert Matt Forrest as they race across the globe to recover stolen treasures. The Chief suspects Carmen, but solid evidence is scarce, forcing Julia and Adam Shadow to follow a trail of clues and unravel a complex web of deception.\n\nThis unique adventure blends thrilling detective work with a literary twist. As you investigate, you’ll encounter 100 classic works of literature, cleverly integrated into puzzles and challenges. Decipher riddles inspired by Shakespeare, solve mysteries rooted in Dickens, and navigate scenarios drawn from the world’s most beloved stories. \n\nUtilize the DS’s touch screen to examine evidence, interrogate suspects, and piece together the digital map of Atlantis – unaware that Carmen is manipulating your every move! Can you outsmart the notorious thief and recover the stolen treasures before the world discovers the truth? Prepare for a captivating journey filled with intrigue, literary puzzles, and the cunning of Carmen Sandiego!"
    },
